  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INSPIRE Wilton Park</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the follow-up to the pledges made at the Global Refugee Forum, refugee-host country governments and international partners will gather to discuss implementation progress of including refugee populations into host country schools. With the financing, technical support and political will in place, it is time for action. Wilton Park will serve as a venue for learning from similar contexts, comparing operational approaches, and building relationships of trust across institutions and partners to support countries with inclusion efforts. 
The agenda would be structured around operational questions on how to carry out refugee-inclusion activities in these countries.</narrative>
  </description>
